      "rationale": "claim 三段内容与引文逐句对应：[0,62)（\"There are many noise reduction algorithms in image processing.\"）支撑\"图像处理中有许多降噪算法\"；[137,185)（\"the available computer power and time available;\"）支撑\"权衡可用算力与时间\"；[186,275)（\"whether sacrificing some real detail is acceptable if it allows more noise to be removed;\"）支撑\"是否接受牺牲细节以换取更多噪声去除\"；[276,341)（\"and the characteristics of the noise and the detail in the image,\"）支撑\"以及图像中噪声与细节的特性\"。claim 未引入引文之外的信息，仅省略了框架性词组\"one must weigh several factors\"与末句\"to better make those decisions\"，属忠实译述，故 supported。注：审计输入未含源文档全文，offset 为相对所引 evidence 引文文本的 Unicode 码点区间。",
